AI Bug Triage Workflow
Automate the transformation of messy, natural language bug reports into structured, system-ready data for Jira and Slack.

🛠️ How it Works
Extraction: Uses OpenAI's Structured Outputs (JSON Schema) to force LLM responses into a strictly defined format.

Validation: Automatically validates data types (booleans, arrays) and enforces severity enums (low to critical).

Intelligence: Detects missing info rather than hallucinating and identifies Release Blockers based on context.

Integration: Generates ready-to-use payloads for Jira tickets and real-time Slack alerts.
